sequenceDiagram
    participant MM as ModelMesh Controller
    participant Puller as model-serving-puller<br/>8084/TCP gRPC
    participant Storage as Cloud Storage<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant FS as Local Filesystem<br/>/models/{model_id}/
    participant Adapter as Runtime Adapter<br/>8085/TCP gRPC
    participant Runtime as Inference Runtime<br/>8001/7071/TCP

    Note over MM,Runtime: Flow 1: Model Load (Puller + Adapter Mode)

    MM->>Puller: LoadModel(modelId, modelPath)<br/>gRPC plaintext (pod-local)
    Puller->>Storage: Download model artifacts<br/>HTTPS TLS 1.2+<br/>Auth: Per-provider credentials
    Storage-->>Puller: Model files
    Puller->>FS: Write to /models/{model_id}/
    Puller->>Adapter: LoadModel(modelId, modelPath)<br/>gRPC plaintext (pod-local)
    Note over Adapter: Adapt model layout:<br/>- Triton: config.pbtxt<br/>- MLServer: model-settings.json<br/>- OVMS: model_config_list.json<br/>- TorchServe: MAR registration
    Adapter->>Runtime: Load model via native API<br/>gRPC/HTTP plaintext (pod-local)
    Runtime-->>Adapter: Load confirmation
    Adapter-->>Puller: LoadModel response (SizeInBytes)
    Puller-->>MM: LoadModel response

    Note over MM,Runtime: Flow 2: Model Load (Embedded Puller Mode)

    MM->>Adapter: LoadModel(modelId, modelPath)<br/>gRPC plaintext (pod-local)
    Note over Adapter: USE_EMBEDDED_PULLER=true
    Adapter->>Storage: Download model artifacts<br/>HTTPS TLS 1.2+<br/>Auth: Per-provider credentials
    Storage-->>Adapter: Model files
    Adapter->>FS: Write to /models/{model_id}/
    Note over Adapter: Adapt model layout
    Adapter->>Runtime: Load model via native API<br/>gRPC/HTTP plaintext (pod-local)
    Runtime-->>Adapter: Load confirmation
    Adapter-->>MM: LoadModel response

    Note over MM,Runtime: Flow 3: Keras Model Conversion (Triton Only)

    MM->>Puller: LoadModel (Keras .h5 model)
    Puller->>Storage: Download .h5 file
    Storage-->>Puller: Keras .h5 model
    Puller->>FS: Write .h5 to /models/{model_id}/
    Puller->>Adapter: LoadModel (Triton adapter)
    Note over Adapter: Detect Keras model type
    Adapter->>Adapter: subprocess: python /opt/scripts/tf_pb.py<br/>Convert .h5 → TF SavedModel
    Adapter->>Runtime: RepositoryModelLoad<br/>gRPC 8001/TCP plaintext
    Runtime-->>Adapter: Load confirmation
    Adapter-->>Puller: LoadModel response
    Puller-->>MM: LoadModel response

    Note over MM,Runtime: Flow 4: Model Unload

    MM->>Puller: UnloadModel(modelId)
    Puller->>Adapter: UnloadModel(modelId)<br/>gRPC plaintext
    Adapter->>Runtime: Unload via native API
    Runtime-->>Adapter: Unload confirmation
    Adapter->>FS: Remove /models/{model_id}/
    Adapter-->>Puller: UnloadModel response
    Puller-->>MM: UnloadModel response
